-             '\n'
-             '\n'
-             'Debugger Commands\n'
-             '=================\n'
-             '\n'
-             'The commands recognized by the debugger are listed below.  Most\n'
-             'commands can be abbreviated to one or two letters as indicated; '
-             'e.g.\n'
-             '"h(elp)" means that either "h" or "help" can be used to enter '
