-             '\n'
-             'disable bpnumber [bpnumber ...]\n'
-             '\n'
-             '   Disable the breakpoints given as a space separated list of\n'
-             '   breakpoint numbers.  Disabling a breakpoint means it cannot '
-             'cause\n'
