-          '\n'
-          '\n'
-          'Mappings\n'
-          '========\n'
-          '\n'
-          'These represent finite sets of objects indexed by arbitrary index\n'
-          'sets. The subscript notation "a[k]" selects the item indexed by '
-          '"k"\n'
