-          '\n'
-          'The extension modules "dbm.ndbm" and "dbm.gnu" provide additional\n'
-          'examples of mapping types, as does the "collections" module.\n'
-          '\n'
-          'Changed in version 3.7: Dictionaries did not preserve insertion '
