-          'was\n'
-          'preserved, but it was considered an implementation detail at that '
-          'time\n'
-          'rather than a language guarantee.\n'
-          '\n'
-          '\n'
-          'Callable types\n'
-          '==============\n'
-          '\n'
-          'These are the types to which the function call operation (see '
